{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060635/block/singleImage/3250408/wm/01M5YT6K8WJHSTVKC3476Z9CD3.jpeg?updatedAt=1793109355\"/><figcaption>星堤三房套獲同區換樓客承接。(代理提供)</figcaption></figure><p>晉誠地產高級營業經理姚頌溏表示，分行最新促成屯門掃管笏星堤 7 座高層 C 室成交，單位實用面積約 918 方呎，屬三房套加工人套房間隔，享西南內園景觀。 姚頌溏指，單位原開價 810 萬元，經議價後減價 18 萬元，以 792 萬元沽出，呎價約 8,627 元，新買家為同區換樓客。 單位 15 年間升值 139 萬 據悉，原業主於 2011 年以 653 萬元買入單位，持貨約 15 年轉售，帳面獲利 139 萬元，物業期內升值約 21.3% 。資料顯示，星堤位於掃管笏管翠路 1 號， 2011 年入伙，共有 10 座住宅大樓及洋房 30 間，提供 459 個單位。</p><p>即睇屯門掃管笏星堤放盤 (House730)</p><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060635/block/singleImage/3250414/df/01M5YT84CCBZD5VSPZNAR519Z4.jpeg?updatedAt=1793109355\"/></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T14:44:14.512468+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":330,"images":2,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T13:55:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T05:38:15.986692+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T14:40:25.304785+00:00","content_hash":"ee50452dd2c8ca9b0ac77f7593c8b48540ce8166a6db2dc5d78e8140b7b3ba90","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T14:44:14.512468+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}